+
+## block 33 — supervisor controls, primary, refuting pass and fold (2026-09-17)
+Lens: the `c = 1` construction is an existence statement; attack it by induction on levels through the rooted value. Controls: rooted values at every site of `63` realizations by the integer program with a level cap (`supervisor_control_block33_rooted.py`: no processed site above `0`, no amplified above `−1`); the hard cases listed (`..._tight.py`: all with seed predecessors only); three candidate lemmas tabulated (`..._lemmas.py`); climbs for tight sibling pairs and for violations, random and seeded from the extremal realizations (`..._tightpairs.py`, `..._violate.py`: none); a greedy harvesting rule scored against the oracle and found far from it (forks are essential); shape statistics of optimal trees (`..._shape.py`, `..._shape2.py`: never two processed children at a node; the restriction cost-free at `c = 1`, one unit on `W3` at `c = 2`); the kind-typed eight-variable count (`..._restricted_count.py`), after two tooling fixes reproducing `4165/2085` and `453/232` exactly, then reduced to three variables; certificates by block 30's displacement (`..._certify33.py`) after the eight-variable attempt failed on scaling (`..._kind_certs.py`, `..._diag.py`). Lens pass on the contract: the regions `2921` and `405` unclaimed; the counter-case reported; the open lemma stated in one sentence. Primary: T1 (lemmas, reduction; instances by exact rooted brute force), T2 (the extremal realizations), T3 (the up-factor identity; eight certificates; block 30's under the same code), T4 (admissibility on tiny realizations); runner 18 checks, 7 mutations. Refuting pass (`CHECKER_block33_findings.md`): nothing refuted on four items. Fold: the seeds' rooted value is `≤ 0` (sibling seeds joined by forks), not `= 0`. Census 7/7 in-family.
+
+## block 33 — conformance gate (REVIEW_LOOP_PR_CONFORMANCE_SPEC sections 1-12, author pass, 2026-09-17)
+1 self-containment: PASS — inputs: this note, the axioms memo, block 01's note, all on `main` at `9a3ffc8d91`; the objects of blocks 25/30/31/32 restated as declared objects and data and re-executed; evidence addresses. 2 cache/execution: PASS. 3 claim-scope honesty: PASS — a reduction with its open lemma named; two conditional regions with exact certificates explicitly not claimed; the counter-case reported. 4 N-gate: PASS (N1–N8; N5 lines in the runner). 5–7: PASS. 8: run at the gates. 9–11: PASS. 12: run before the PR.
