+hard cases (processed z with all 1-preds seeds or tight): 116; pred-kind patterns: {('seed', 'seed'): 115, ('seed', 'seed', 'seed'): 1}
+mechanism (v(z), #preds in tree, seeds, forks): [((-17, 2, 6, 5), 1), ((-12, 2, 5, 4), 1), ((-11, 2, 4, 3), 1), ((-9, 2, 4, 3), 9), ((-8, 2, 4, 3), 7), ((-7, 2, 3, 2), 2), ((-7, 2, 4, 3), 2), ((-6, 2, 3, 2), 6), ((-5, 2, 3, 2), 21), ((-5, 3, 3, 2), 1), ((-4, 2, 2, 1), 2), ((-3, 2, 2, 1), 11), ((-2, 2, 2, 1), 52)]
+103 realizations, 660 processed nodes
+tight processed nodes (v = 0): [('Z_A', (3, 3, 3), [((2, 3, 3), 'proc', -1), ((3, 2, 3), 'proc', -1), ((3, 3, 2), 'proc', -1)]), ('Z_B', (4, 4, 4), [((3, 4, 4), 'proc', -1), ((4, 3, 4), 'proc', -1), ((4, 4, 3), 'proc', 0)]), ('Z_B', (4, 4, 3), [((3, 4, 3), 'proc', -1), ((4, 3, 3), 'proc', -1), ((4, 4, 2), 'proc', -1)])]
+L1 (seed pred => v <= -1): 253 cases, violations 0
+L2 (>= 3 one-preds => v <= -1): 110 cases, violations 3
+L3 (two processed preds, no seed/amp: some pred v <= -1 or v(z) <= -1): 135 cases, violations 0
