+sanity: unrestricted at (4150,1,2) c=2 (should fail): None
+c=2 restriction=none line (p,1,2): least p with a convergent count on the t-grid: 4165  (t, R) = (0.099, 7.691556038874724e-08)
+c=2 restriction=none line (p,1,1): least p with a convergent count on the t-grid: 2085  (t, R) = (0.099, 6.62692407331491e-08)
